" bug fixes. Details `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/ArduCopter-3.2/ArduCopter/ReleaseNotes.txt>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/project-news.rst:51 44109e905d2443f0a60eb6a4a6d5f589
